{"id": "EUVD-2026-97891", "enisaUuid": "376f83fe-2e7a-30ee-9a1a-1c132c1dd54e", "description": "Shaark 1.2.13 through 1.2.44 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the Link, Story, Chest and Album API controllers that skips ownership checks. Authenticated non-admin users can send PUT or DELETE requests to /api/{link,story,chest,album}/{id} with numeric IDs to overwrite or delete other users' content, including private items.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T20:55:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T17:47:33", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/MarceauKa/shaark/pull/110", "https://github.com/MarceauKa/shaark/blob/1.2.44/app/Http/Controllers/Api/LinkController.php", "https://github.com/MarceauKa/shaark", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/shaark-1.2.13-through-1.2.44-missing-authorization-via-api-update-and-delete-routes"], "aliases": ["GHSA-33mg-5c73-726g", "CVE-2026-109568"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0fdb7181-1444-3d95-a110-b73cf825b323", "product": {"name": "Shaark", "vendor": {"name": "MarceauKa"}}, "product_version": "1.2.13 \u22641.2.44"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c8ccae5d-25e5-3940-b57f-6f8b15e79a7b", "vendor": {"name": "MarceauKa"}}], "isExploited": false}